    "Name": "Thanatos TNS-6T",
    "Details": "The TNS-6T is a practical refresh and refit of the TNS-4S that prioritizes versatile firepower and close-in staying power. It pairs a snub-nose PPC with a nine-tube multi-missile launcher, using solid mobility to press targets as a capable brawler while retaining mixed-range options. Compared with later -7D variants, it stands out for straightforward, rugged armament and wide availability rather than advanced electronics or specialty munitions.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.09</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
